sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EVConnectedPreSession

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = Authorized, idToken = <Valid id token configured in Authorization Cache>, eventType = Updated)
    Note right of CS: Note: TxStartPoint contains ParkingBayOccupancy
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse (idTokenInfo.status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
